{"value":{"canonicalId":"10877","canonicalProvider":"KITSU","contentType":"SERIES","displayHash":"fb81d91a24f0fbe495d0628ab2cdf3df68ae4160ea56fbf524426acac5d5f623","expiresAtMs":1778835704553,"fieldTrace":[{"field":"TITLE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"OVERVIEW","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"POSTER","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"RPDB","sourceRole":"ARTWORK"},{"field":"BACKDROP","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RATING","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"RUNTIME","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RELEASE_DATE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"REMOTE_IDS","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"CANONICAL_ID","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"}],"fields":{"backdrop":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/10877/original.jpg","description":"The students return as school is back in session for the second semester. Following their exploits on the island during summer vacation, Class 3-E continues to sharpen their blades with their sights set on their teacher, the slippery Koro-sensei. They have more to worry about than just their teacher, however, as enemy assassins, both old and new, are out for the increased bounty on the octopus' head.

Moreover, their rivals in Class A, as well as Kunugigaoka Junior High's fearsome principal, stand to block Class E from achieving academic excellence. With all of these obstacles opposing them, the group must continue to work together in order to overcome their foes and accomplish their goal of successfully assassinating their teacher.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)","genres":[],"imdbRating":7.9,"poster":"nexio-artwork://decision/artwork-decision:poster:canonical:imdb:tt3837246:provider:RPDB:premium:true:settings:348ee7a03812654a1bed8f378de9fa35d7b75ec130bc7d28d035bcff69949d3b:credential:b8c0287672c33e5d5a391b8290c231a0afb35b5c543dd6f535c6ef2f1e14c87c:imageLang:en:policy:1","posterProviderTag":"rpdb","ratingSource":"IMDB","releaseInfo":"2016","runtime":"23","title":"Assassination Classroom Second Season"},"imdbId":"tt3837246","itemKey":"series:kitsu:10877","languageTag":"nl","overlayKey":"canonical:KITSU:10877:type:SERIES:lang:nl:policy:1","policyVersion":1,"staleAtMs":1778317304553,"state":"CANONICAL_READY","updatedAtMs":1778230904553},"schemaVersion":1}

{"value":{"canonicalId":"10740","canonicalProvider":"KITSU","contentType":"SERIES","displayHash":"109e2398afb24d7fc74c6db6bcb34a56afa24b161de0d56dd43e476222562385","expiresAtMs":1778835705430,"fieldTrace":[{"field":"TITLE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"OVERVIEW","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"POSTER","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"RPDB","sourceRole":"ARTWORK"},{"field":"BACKDROP","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RATING","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"RUNTIME","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RELEASE_DATE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"REMOTE_IDS","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"CANONICAL_ID","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"}],"fields":{"backdrop":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/10740/original.jpg","description":"The seemingly ordinary and unimpressive Saitama has a rather unique hobby: being a hero. In order to pursue his childhood dream, he trained relentlessly for three years—and lost all of his hair in the process. Now, Saitama is incredibly powerful, so much so that no enemy is able to defeat him in battle. In fact, all it takes to defeat evildoers with just one punch has led to an unexpected problem—he is no longer able to enjoy the thrill of battling and has become quite bored.

This all changes with the arrival of Genos, a 19-year-old cyborg, who wishes to be Saitama's disciple after seeing what he is capable of. Genos proposes that the two join the Hero Association in order to become certified heroes that will be recognized for their positive contributions to society, and Saitama, shocked that no one knows who he is, quickly agrees. And thus begins the story of One Punch Man, an action-comedy that follows an eccentric individual who longs to fight strong enemies that can hopefully give him the excitement he once felt and just maybe, he'll become popular in the process.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)","genres":[],"imdbRating":8.6,"poster":"nexio-artwork://decision/artwork-decision:poster:canonical:imdb:tt4508902:provider:RPDB:premium:true:settings:348ee7a03812654a1bed8f378de9fa35d7b75ec130bc7d28d035bcff69949d3b:credential:b8c0287672c33e5d5a391b8290c231a0afb35b5c543dd6f535c6ef2f1e14c87c:imageLang:en:policy:1","posterProviderTag":"rpdb","ratingSource":"IMDB","releaseInfo":"2015","runtime":"24","title":"One Punch Man"},"imdbId":"tt4508902","itemKey":"series:kitsu:10740","languageTag":"nl","overlayKey":"canonical:KITSU:10740:type:SERIES:lang:nl:policy:1","policyVersion":1,"staleAtMs":1778317305430,"state":"CANONICAL_READY","updatedAtMs":1778230905430},"schemaVersion":1}

{"value":{"canonicalId":"11209","canonicalProvider":"KITSU","contentType":"SERIES","displayHash":"bf5890a43d154057866e504fbbb180a05e4a7833b27e5e7d0911a7528d1483e6","expiresAtMs":1778767157190,"fieldTrace":[{"field":"TITLE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"OVERVIEW","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"POSTER","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"RPDB","sourceRole":"ARTWORK"},{"field":"BACKDROP","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RATING","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"TMDB","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"RELEASE_DATE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"TMDB","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"GENRES","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"TMDB","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"RUNTIME","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"REMOTE_IDS","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"CANONICAL_ID","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"}],"fields":{"backdrop":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/11209/original.jpg","description":"When Subaru Natsuki leaves the convenience store, the last thing he expects is to be wrenched from his everyday life and dropped into a fantasy world. Things aren't looking good for the bewildered teenager; however, not long after his arrival, he is attacked by some thugs. Armed with only a bag of groceries and a now useless cell phone, he is quickly beaten to a pulp. Fortunately, a mysterious beauty named Satella, in hot pursuit after the one who stole her insignia, happens upon Subaru and saves him. In order to thank the honest and kindhearted girl, Subaru offers to help in her search, and later that night, he even finds the whereabouts of that which she seeks. But unbeknownst to them, a much darker force stalks the pair from the shadows, and just minutes after locating the insignia, Subaru and Satella are brutally murdered.

However, Subaru immediately reawakens to a familiar scene—confronted by the same group of thugs, meeting Satella all over again—the enigma deepens as history inexplicably repeats itself.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)","genres":["Animation","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Mystery"],"imdbRating":7.8,"poster":"nexio-artwork://decision/artwork-decision:poster:canonical:imdb:tt5607616:provider:RPDB:premium:true:settings:348ee7a03812654a1bed8f378de9fa35d7b75ec130bc7d28d035bcff69949d3b:credential:b8c0287672c33e5d5a391b8290c231a0afb35b5c543dd6f535c6ef2f1e14c87c:imageLang:en:policy:1","posterProviderTag":"rpdb","ratingSource":"TMDB","releaseInfo":"2016","runtime":"25","title":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-"},"itemKey":"series:tmdb:65942","languageTag":"en","overlayKey":"canonical:KITSU:11209:type:SERIES:lang:en:policy:1","policyVersion":1,"staleAtMs":1778248757190,"state":"CANONICAL_READY","updatedAtMs":1778162357190},"schemaVersion":1}

{"value":{"canonicalId":"8640","canonicalProvider":"KITSU","contentType":"SERIES","displayHash":"6f0fbdc8e5d6ddd2fd55ea18ae927c8bc225c6aaf56220c42f6fed107550144f","expiresAtMs":1778633361062,"fieldTrace":[{"field":"TITLE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"OVERVIEW","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"POSTER","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"RPDB","sourceRole":"ARTWORK"},{"field":"BACKDROP","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RATING","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"RELEASE_DATE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"RUNTIME","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"REMOTE_IDS","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"CANONICAL_ID","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"}],"fields":{"backdrop":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/8640/original.jpg","description":"When a mysterious creature chops the moon down to a permanent crescent, the students of class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Middle School find themselves confronted with an enormous task: assassinate the creature responsible for the disaster before Earth suffers a similar fate. However, the monster, dubbed Koro-sensei (the indestructible teacher), is able to fly at speeds of up to Mach 20, which he demonstrates freely, leaving any attempt to subdue him in his extraterrestrial dust. Furthermore, the misfits of 3-E soon find that the strange, tentacled beast is more than just indomitable—he is the best teacher they have ever had!

Adapted from the humorous hit manga by Yuusei Matsui, Ansatsu Kyoushitsu tells the story of these junior high pupils as they polish their assassination skills and grow in order to stand strong against the oppressive school system, their own life problems, and one day, Koro-sensei.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)","genres":[],"imdbRating":7.9,"poster":"nexio-artwork://decision/artwork-decision:poster:canonical:imdb:tt3837246:provider:RPDB:premium:true:settings:348ee7a03812654a1bed8f378de9fa35d7b75ec130bc7d28d035bcff69949d3b:credential:b8c0287672c33e5d5a391b8290c231a0afb35b5c543dd6f535c6ef2f1e14c87c:imageLang:en:policy:1","posterProviderTag":"rpdb","ratingSource":"IMDB","releaseInfo":"2015","runtime":"23","title":"Assassination Classroom"},"imdbId":"tt3837246","itemKey":"series:kitsu:8640","languageTag":"nl","overlayKey":"canonical:KITSU:8640:type:SERIES:lang:nl:policy:1","policyVersion":1,"staleAtMs":1778114961062,"state":"CANONICAL_READY","updatedAtMs":1778028561062},"schemaVersion":1}

