{"value":{"canonicalId":"11469","canonicalProvider":"KITSU","contentType":"SERIES","displayHash":"26cf7bfb129a89e5385969df5544da67b7e6aa5d9236cf793c472491da6250d8","expiresAtMs":1778835708289,"fieldTrace":[{"field":"TITLE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"OVERVIEW","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"POSTER","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"RPDB","sourceRole":"ARTWORK"},{"field":"BACKDROP","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RATING","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"RUNTIME","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RELEASE_DATE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"REMOTE_IDS","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"CANONICAL_ID","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"}],"fields":{"backdrop":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/11469/original.jpg","description":"What would the world be like if 80 percent of the population manifested extraordinary superpowers called “Quirks” at age four? Heroes and villains would be battling it out everywhere! Becoming a hero would mean learning to use your power, but where would you go to study? U.A. High's Hero Program of course! But what would you do if you were one of the 20 percent who were born Quirkless?

Middle school student Izuku Midoriya wants to be a hero more than anything, but he hasn't got an ounce of power in him. With no chance of ever getting into the prestigious U.A. High School for budding heroes, his life is looking more and more like a dead end. Then an encounter with All Might, the greatest hero of them all gives him a chance to change his destiny…

(Source: Viz Media)","genres":[],"imdbRating":8.3,"poster":"nexio-artwork://decision/artwork-decision:poster:canonical:imdb:tt5626028:provider:RPDB:premium:true:settings:348ee7a03812654a1bed8f378de9fa35d7b75ec130bc7d28d035bcff69949d3b:credential:b8c0287672c33e5d5a391b8290c231a0afb35b5c543dd6f535c6ef2f1e14c87c:imageLang:en:policy:1","posterProviderTag":"rpdb","ratingSource":"IMDB","releaseInfo":"2016","runtime":"23","title":"My Hero Academia"},"imdbId":"tt5626028","itemKey":"series:kitsu:11469","languageTag":"nl","overlayKey":"canonical:KITSU:11469:type:SERIES:lang:nl:policy:1","policyVersion":1,"staleAtMs":1778317308289,"state":"CANONICAL_READY","updatedAtMs":1778230908289},"schemaVersion":1}

{"value":{"canonicalId":"7442","canonicalProvider":"KITSU","contentType":"SERIES","displayHash":"74f4c15bc970f54626f44198b17492484b0ed332bd29c4935b9d9289a1b430fe","expiresAtMs":1778835709267,"fieldTrace":[{"field":"TITLE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"OVERVIEW","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"POSTER","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"RPDB","sourceRole":"ARTWORK"},{"field":"BACKDROP","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RATING","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"RUNTIME","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"RELEASE_DATE","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"RAIL_PREVIEW"},{"field":"REMOTE_IDS","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"},{"field":"CANONICAL_ID","rejectedCandidates":[],"selectedProvider":"KITSU","sourceRole":"PRIMARY"}],"fields":{"backdrop":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/7442/original.png","description":"Centuries ago, mankind was slaughtered to near extinction by monstrous humanoid creatures called titans, forcing humans to hide in fear behind enormous concentric walls. What makes these giants truly terrifying is that their taste for human flesh is not born out of hunger but what appears to be out of pleasure. To ensure their survival, the remnants of humanity began living within defensive barriers, resulting in one hundred years without a single titan encounter. However, that fragile calm is soon shattered when a colossal titan manages to breach the supposedly impregnable outer wall, reigniting the fight for survival against the man-eating abominations.

After witnessing a horrific personal loss at the hands of the invading creatures, Eren Yeager dedicates his life to their eradication by enlisting into the Survey Corps, an elite military unit that combats the merciless humanoids outside the protection of the walls. Based on Hajime Isayama's award-winning manga, Shingeki no Kyojin follows Eren, along with his adopted sister Mikasa Ackerman and his childhood friend Armin Arlert, as they join the brutal war against the titans and race to discover a way of defeating them before the last walls are breached.

